# Design

Regarding the initial design, I just generated a quick to use logo with a theme palette I found online and created a palette image (assets\palette\colour-palette.png) to follow.
I made the decision to seperate styling segment, such colours,typography, into their own individual parts, keeping global as the pure structure.
I like this for multiple reasons, including semantic naming and potential avenues for shared brand configuration (Should this be a multi-brand product down the line)

